                {'stem': 'Maintaining professional boundaries with patients means you:', 'options': ['Keep the relationship strictly therapeutic', 'Add every patient on your social media', 'Share your home address with patients', 'Meet patients socially for their treatment'], 'correct': [0], 'qtype': 'single', 'kind': 'theory', 'explanation': 'Professional boundaries protect the therapeutic relationship and both parties from harm.', 'reasoning_eligible': False},
