                {'stem': 'The over-arching purpose of professional ethics and conduct in the eye clinic is to:', 'options': ['Protect patient safety, dignity and rights', 'Increase the overall clinic revenue further', 'Reduce the daily workload on the staff', 'Impress the visiting inspectors only'], 'correct': [0], 'qtype': 'single', 'kind': 'theory', 'explanation': "Ethical practice safeguards patients' safety, dignity and rights and sustains public trust in the profession.", 'reasoning_eligible': False},
