                {'stem': 'A wheelchair-bound patient scores high on the fall assessment. Precautions should:', 'options': ['Still be applied, as transfers carry risk', 'Be skipped because the patient is already seated', 'Only apply if the patient is able to walk about', 'Be removed entirely for a patient like this'], 'correct': [0], 'qtype': 'single', 'kind': 'situational', 'explanation': 'Wheelchair users are still at risk during transfers and toileting; fall precautions and safe-transfer support remain important.', 'reasoning_eligible': True},
