                {'stem': 'A confrontation field at the bedside is grossly full, but the patient reports difficulty. The appropriate next step is often to:', 'options': ['Arrange formal perimetry, as confrontation is coarse', 'Conclude the field is perfect and reassure the patient', 'Ignore the symptom that the patient has described', 'Repeat the same confrontation test again and again'], 'correct': [0], 'qtype': 'single', 'kind': 'situational', 'explanation': 'Confrontation detects only gross defects; symptomatic patients need formal perimetry to quantify the field.', 'reasoning_eligible': True},
